window.products.push({"id":995091,"name":"Transform Cooking with Red+Black Eco-Friendly Silicone Slow Cooker Divider Inserts - Non-Stick, Dishwasher Safe! Fits 6-8 Quart Brands","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ABy4QAJ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【🧼 Easy to Clean & Maintain】Our non-stick silicone slow cooker liner is easy to clean and dishwasher safe, keeping your slow cooker free of food residue and grease. 【♻️ Eco-friendly & Safe】Made from safe and eco-friendly materials, our crock-pot liner is reusable and prevents environmental pollution caused by disposable bags. 【🎉 Innovative Design for Convenient Cooking】Our two-compartment slow cooker divider insert has a unique design with a pouring spout, non-slip handle, and thickened bottom for even heat distribution. 【🔥 High-quality & Durable Material】Our food-grade silicone liner is heat-resistant up to 464℉ (240℃), free of BPA, and has passed FDA tests, ensuring your safety while cooking delicious meals. 【👍 Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed】We are committed to providing you with the best-in-market slow cooker liners and exceptional service. If you have any questions, concerns, or need support with our product, contact us at any time. We promise to respond within 12 hours and offer a lifetime replacement service to ensure you can cook with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ABy4QAJ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PRANAHEART","source_asin":"B0BVM99BH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVM99BH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVM99BH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":995092,"name":"Bunny IV by Marion Rose, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JJ6c0xd0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a rabbit looking towards the right side of the frame. Most days, one would find Marion Rose putting on her favorite music or playing an old video before settling in to paint for the day in her spacious studio, especially once the winter chill set in. Her work is influenced by past masters such as Joaquin Sorolla, Tom Thomson, Carl Rungius, Bob Kuhn, and many others that work today in a variety of subject and media. She also studied printmaking, life painting and drawing in college in her 30's. Her subjects come from her life of traveling enthusiastically as often as she could, both close to home or across the ocean. Sketching and studying animals were a favorite pastime, setting an excellent foundation for creating authentic work. Texture and richly colored paint applied generously by knife or brush strokes capture the essence of a subject's spirit and demeanor. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JJ6c0xd0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0711T8SZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0711T8SZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0711T8SZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
