window.products.push({"id":995408,"name":"A Cheerful Giver - Brownie Batter - 24oz Large Scented Candle Jar with Lid - Cheerful Candle - 135 Hours, Candles Gifts for Women, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pN9YhB4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SCENTED CANDLES: Experience the brilliant essence and enliven your mood with the gentle, sweet, and intoxicating ambiance of our unique candles. Brighten your entire home with the uplifting and delicate aromatic blend of dark chocolatey batter goodness, drizzled in fudge & topped with sprinkled brown sugar. HOME DECOR ESSENTIAL: All of our candles are proudly made in the USA and are a fantastic enhancement to any space. Whether you add them to your living room or are looking to boost the kitchen decor, these exhilarating ornamental jars are a must-have. QUALITY CANDLE WAX: These heartwarming long burning candles are crafted with a double wick to increase burn times and decrease soot. The balance of wax to wick ensures that the candle will burn clean, guaranteeing hours of long-lasting fragrance. UNIQUE GIFTS: Give that special someone in your life a gift to remember with our Small aromatherapy candles. Delight your family, friends, and neighbors with the unforgettable scent that can only be captured in these one-of-a-kind luxury candles. A CHEERFUL GIVER: A Cheerful Giver was established in 1991 and is a business dedicated to creating and producing innovative and quality products at an affordable price. We strive for excellence and pride ourselves on giving back to the community.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pN9YhB4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Cheerful Giver","source_asin":"B09S5V4Q4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S5V4Q4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S5V4Q4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":995409,"name":"100pcs Adult beverage pouches plastic freezable Clear Alcohol Concealable flask to sneak cocktails vodka booze for travel,concert and musical festival","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RlLH4Uu6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a drink anywhere and bringing water,beverages,liquors,wine with you when traveling or beach time is ready,that's fantastic!So here is what our drink pouches for. Product Description: Size:7.4oz/8.4oz/11.8oz/12.8oz/14.2oz/16.9oz/33.82oz Style:Straight/Oblique Features: 1.No worry for the X-ray Scanner:Made with 100% BPA FREE FOOD GRADE plastic.Leak proof,Odor Proof,perfect for concealment,undetectable by x-Ray scanners. 2.plastic frozen pouches:it's wonderfunl to refrigerate the beverage in summer for a cooler experience. 3.NO PLASTIC TASTE AT ALL - Compared to metal flasks that usually have metal taste,the plastic ones have no issues with taste at all.They are also easy to clean and can be used repeatedly 4.Save Overpriced Drink during the Cruise trip:you can wrap them in clothing ,in luggage.It's also perfect for taking any non-carbonated beverage to Concerts,Stadiums,Clubs,Bars,Movie Theaters,Tailgating,Glass-Free Beaches,Pool Parties,Fishing,Hunting,Camping,Golf, etc. 5.Concealable plastic flasks can be fold for easy storage, screw cap can help to seal the bag tightly,no leaks,very helpful for carrying with when going out. 5.Drinks flasks are washable,can easily be cleaned with clean water and soap for repeated using,can provide a long service time. INSTRUCTIONS: 1.It is recommended to remove and discard the O-Rings from the caps, and twist the caps as tight as possible to avoid leakage 2.Hold the Flask with the spout up and squeeze to expel air until liquid is in spout 3.Use funnel to fill the Flask to no more than 80% of its capacity 4.Wash flask with soap and water,rinse thoroughly, inflate flask with a puff of air,turn upside down with cap off,and let dry.(Wash before using) Package Included: 1X100pcs Drink Pouches 1XFunnel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RlLH4Uu6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Package","source_asin":"B09JSQYNNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JSQYNNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JSQYNNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
