window.products.push({"id":995537,"name":"Premium Reusable Produce Bags. Made in The USA. Made in Vermont. Mesh Vegetable Bags. Set of 4 Ecofriendly Washable with Tare Weight. Unique Drawstrin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uuh20ax-L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Use our eco-friendly reusable produce bags to do your part not only in reducing the amount of plastic waste making its way into our ecosystems but also supporting American workers. Our 100 percent food-safe polyester fabric is Made in the United States and skillfully stitched together in Northern Vermont, USA. We created bags that we could proudly present to our family, friends, and neighbors with the knowledge that the labor and materials were always close to home. Bring these bags to your local farmers market or grocery store and fill them full of nutritious fruits and vegetables. Travel home, wash and store your produce, and bring your kitchen reusable grocery bags back to the market for more. Be responsible with Stellar Earth Wares Reusable Produce Bags and buy yours today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uuh20ax-L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stellar Earth Wares","source_asin":"B084QG3F1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084QG3F1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084QG3F1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":995538,"name":"Nuwave PIC Flex Compact, Portable, Powerful Induction Cooktop With 9-inch Duralon Healthy Ceramic Non-Stick Fry Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xw5mDS1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRECISE TEMPERATURE CONTROL – Sear a steak at 500°F, keep sauces warm at 100°F, or select from 45 precise temperature settings with the simple press of a button. SAFE & EFFICIENT – By generating heat directly in the cookware with no open flames or hot coils, the PIC Flex can cook safer, faster and more efficiently than traditional stovetops. PORTABLE COOKING CAPABILITIES – With a lightweight, compact design and adjustable wattage control, the PIC Flex lets you cook virtually anywhere without sacrificing any of its precise temperature control. ADVANCED INDUCTION TECHNOLOGY – The 6.5-inch induction heating coil generates heat directly in your cookware quickly and evenly, ensuring no hot or cold spots for a better cooking experience. NUWAVE INNOVATION – NUWAVE Induction Cooktops are the first induction cooktops to revolutionize the industry by introducing precision temperatures to induction cooking. It was an engineering achievement previously unavailable in the category. SUPERIOR TECHNOLOGY - The slim design of Flex and its patented insulation technology brings the induction heating coils closer to your cookware than the competition for faster & even heating, ensuring no hot or cold spots for optimal cooking experience. COOK LIKE A PRO - Get inspired and confidently create your own masterpieces. Flex is engineered to out-perform your expectations. Whether you’re cooking breakfast, lunch, dinner, or dessert, we have the perfect chef-inspired recipe for you! PROGRAMMABLE FUNCTIONS – With Flex, you can sear, boil, simmer, fry, deep fry, sauté, slow cook, melt, or simply re-heat or keep warm. The applications are endless. Now it’s easy to prepare healthy, great tasting meals with a touch of a button. CHEF INSPIRED FEATURES & FUNCTIONS – Every feature and function of Flex are created and rigorously tested by highly trained NUWAVE chefs and RD team. We obsessed over every detail in pursuit of optimal performance and durability. COOK WITHOUT OIL – The induction-ready, oven-safe 9-inch hard anodized fry pan is made with eco-friendly Duralon Healthy Ceramic Non-Stick Coating ensuring you can cook all your favorites without adding any extra fats or oils to your food for a healthier and tastier experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xw5mDS1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B0BPF1FDZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPF1FDZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPF1FDZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
