window.products.push({"id":995576,"name":"Kihappy Multipurpose Stainless Steel Kitchen Funnel Set with Removable Detachable Strainer Filter Flask Filling for Cooking Oils Liquid, Fluid, Dry In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VdBIFC1SL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"All kitchens need a funnel, and this big one does more than simply transfer liquids from one container to another without creating a mess. You can probably think of a hundred ways to use a stainless steel funnel, so choose a high quality funnel that can handle them all. Kihappy Stainless Steel funnels are the smart home chef's kitchen tools of choice! Stainless Steel Funnel easily fills bottles and jars without a mess. And Our funnel have a Removable Strainer. Insert the detachable screen when you need to strain out larger solids. This is very convenient for you. ADVANTAGES: 1. No more wasting precious essential oils!  2. No more mess pouring spices into small jars! 3. No more spilling pricey liquor filling your flask! 4. Easy to clean, Safe to use in the dishwasher, but hand washing is recommended! 5. Convenient to store: Funnels nest to save space, clip on ring for hanging! 6. Smooth pouring: stem furrow on three largest funnels allows air to escape! 7. No artificial titanium stain or other coloring. Just beautifully mirror-polished stainless steel! 8. 60% thicker than most funnels (0.8mm) with riveted stem for added durability! 9. Strainer eliminates unwanted solid particles when pouring! Package includes: 1 x Stainless Steel Funnel 1 x Removable Strainer Warranty: 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our Stainless Steel Funnel go through rigorous inspection and testing to ensure our customers receive a quality Funnel. In the unlikely event that your product is damaged, defective or not to your standards, we will replace it for you, no hassle! If you choose to return our product for any reason you will receive a full refund within 30 days from purchase, no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VdBIFC1SL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kihappy","source_asin":"B06XTW72R9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XTW72R9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XTW72R9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
