window.products.push({"id":995595,"name":"GiBot Butane Torch, Blow Torch Lighter Kitchen Cooking Torch Chef Culinary Torch with Safety Lock and Adjustable Flame for BBQ, Baking, Creme Brulee, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WqZ2G7VTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WE GUARANTEE ALL BUTANE TORCHES ARE IN HIGH QUALITY ! 12 MONTH GUARANTEE！ Amazing Versatile Butane Torch Lighter!  It's more than for Caramelizes Sugars, Crème Brulee, Culinary Torch also apply in Browns meringues, Barbecue, Skins tomatoes, Melts cheese on Gratins, Roasts pepper, Cigar, Picnics, Camping etc. Let your creativity guide you! Precautions: - Impure Butane Fuel will Shorten Lifetime, recommend Clipper Butane Fuel. BUTANE GAS NOT INCLUDED. - After Refilled, Wait for 5min to Stable the Pressure inside the Bottle.  - Please take a break when Continuously burning for Every 5 minutes.  - Avoid Direct Sunshine. Don't Storage the Torch exceed 50 ℃/122℉.  - Keep out of reach of children, face of other people, yourself and inflammable articles while using.  - Turn off the Gas valve when you are not using it. Steps to Use: Step 1: Gas-refilled - Please insert the Butane Gas Refill bottle vertically to the blow torch bottom as shows in image and wait for 5 secs once, then pull out the fuel bottle, 3 times operation will almost refill blow torch. After refilled, wait for 5 minutes to stable the pressure inside the bottle before igniting the fire.  Step 2: Light the Fire - Turn on the Gas valve by rotating the \" Gas safety knob\" on top, then press the \"trigger-lock button\" to unlock, now press the trigger to ignite Step 3: Continuous Flame and Adjustable Flame level - After ignited the torch, press the \" continuous button\" to lock the flame; adjust the flame level by rotating the \" Gas safety knob\" Step 4: Turn off - Press the trigger again to turn off the gas torch. Specification: - Capacity: 15g butane gas - Flame Temperature: Up to 1300°C/2500°F - Made with ABS, Stainless Steel, Aluminum Alloy - Item size: 14.2 x 6.3 x 17.5 cm/5.5*2.5*6.8 inch - Net weight: 246g/ 8.67ounce","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WqZ2G7VTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gibot","source_asin":"B07DLL9SFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DLL9SFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DLL9SFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
