window.products.push({"id":995616,"name":"Linenwalas Luxury 100% Egyptian Quality Cotton 4Pc Bedding Sheet Set- 800 Thread Count Soft, Silky Sateen Weave, Breathable 16\" Deep Pocket (White, Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CIdMgHjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ BEST SHEETS: Our brand motto is happy sleeping for all and you would truly love these pure cotton high thread count bedsheets & pillowcases. The sheets are soft and subtle and pillowcases are styled for an affordable oppulance. ✅100% COTTON SOFTEST BEDSHEETS: Our fabric is 100% cotton sateen weave which makes the fabric soft, smooth and silky. There is no polyester or poly satin blended in it. There are 800 threads per square inch. which makes it heavy, extremely soft and breathable for a comfortable night’s sleep. Rough cotton balls will not appear on fabric after several washes. The fabric will get softer on subsequent washes. ✅GENEROUS SIZING WITH NO SHRINKAGE: Our flat sheets are generously sized and fitted sheets are snug fit sizes are as per modern mattress sizes with provision for tucking in/ fitting onto the mattress. The fabric is pre shrunk and you won't face shrinkage issues post washing.These are Organic cotton sheets (1 flat/top sheet + 1 fitted/bottom sheet + 2 pillow cases) ethically made in India. We can make upto 16\" deep pockets. ✅STYLED PILLOW COVERS AND FAST COLOURS: The pillow covers have an elegant double pleat which gives your bedding a designer appeal. The nature of pure cotton and hard water makes the colors look dull in no time - however we use high quality colours ensuring that fading is very gradual and unnoticeable. ✅WASH CARE AND DURABILITY: Our fabric is easy machine washed in cold water. We use high quality 3 ply thread for stitching which makes the edges look neat and product durable. Hard water, fabric softeners or bleach are best avoided. Our products are backed up by 100% replacement warranty. We will ensure that you are satisfied with our linens even after several uses. Please feel free to contact us should there be a need, we are happy to help. Happy Sleeping!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CIdMgHjBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linenwalas","source_asin":"B07F72NXTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F72NXTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F72NXTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
