window.products.push({"id":995656,"name":"ChopIT XL Bamboo Cutting Board Set w/ Stand, Juice Grooves, 3 Built-in Compartments | Chopping Board & Butcher Block Resists Cracking & Warping | Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SLAcs2zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INTEGRITY DOESN’T HAVE TO COMPROMISE BEAUTY Bamboo is an intelligent material because it’s natural, safe, and sustainable. It’s also strong and resistant to cracks and moisture. The dense, hearty grain of bamboo fiber gives your kitchen a rustic feel while maintaining the modern aesthetic of simplicity and minimalism. Click ADD TO CART to get yours today. Become Reacquainted with Quality Super sized board 17.5 x 13.5 x 0.8 inches Super sized board 17.5 x 13.5 x 0.8 inches Restore the essence of nature to your kitchen Restore the essence of nature to your kitchen Cut, organize, and serve in one spot, without the mess Cut, organize, and serve in one spot, without the mess Support sustainability with renewable, food-safe bamboo Support sustainability with renewable, food-safe bamboo Store and display the board and other kitchen implements with matching stand. Store and display the board and other kitchen implements with matching stand. Will it Protect my Expensive Knives? A wood or plastic cutting surface is soft and porous so it allows knives to penetrate easily, wearing them down to dull, useless instruments. They’re also prone to nicks and deep grooves where bacteria collect. Bamboo is an innovative and sustainable solution for the kitchen cutting board. Its dense fibers resist wear and tear, preserving the sharpness of your knives. Is Bamboo Durable Enough for Long-Term Use? Bamboo boards are denser and stronger than wooden cutting boards, but not all are made with the same degree of quality. Many boards are just pieces of bamboo glued together. CHOPIT is made with 100% bamboo and chemical-free. It withstands time because quality is our number one imperative. Our No-More-Nicks Guarantee supports your risk-free purchase of the CHOPIT Bamboo Cutting Board and is your ticket to happier, tidier, safer, and more refined meal prep. BUY NOW to start enjoying happier, tidier, safer, and more refined meal prep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SLAcs2zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChopIT","source_asin":"B07JGS1M6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JGS1M6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JGS1M6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
