window.products.push({"id":995666,"name":"Ifblue Solid Thermal Blackout Curtains | Energy-Efficient, Thermally Insulated Drapes with Metal Grommet Rings | Machine Washable Microfiber 42\" x 84\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VWTW82egL._AC_SL1202_.jpg","description":"The magic is in the Microfiber thermal fabric. The innovative Microfiber thermal construction keeps the noise and the draft out, letting you enjoy all the light-blocking, noise reducing and energy saving benefits you want without compromising the style you crave. These classic Thermal Insulated Window Curtains provide the ultimate in blackout performance while helping you save money on heating and cooling your home. Hang them in your living room for better TV viewing or in the nursery or kids' room to keep out unwanted light and noise. Use two window panels on a standard or decorative rod for optimal coverage. Multi-layered Light Blocking Energy Savers. Having the heavy, multi-layered microfiber blackout window curtains or drapes can make a world of a difference in reducing the amount of light that comes in from the outside, which has Eco-conscious consumers excited about investing them as energy-efficient window treatments. The home remains insulated and warmer in wintertime, relieves the strain on home heating and adds up to budget-noticeable energy saving of up to 40 percent. Noise Reduction and Sleep Soother. Blackout curtains encourage the best possible sleep and most comfortable setting for day sleepers and the ones who have trouble falling asleep, by automatically darkening and lowering noise levels. Absolute Security & Comfort. These Blackout curtains will stop the outside world from creeping into your private moments so you can enjoy the privacy with family members and friends to the utmost. It allows you to enjoy all of the light-blocking, noise reducing and energy saving benefits while providing the same fashionable style and elegance of naturally flowing curtains. These curtains come with six galvanized iron grommets with inner diameter: 1.6 inches per panel in one panel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VWTW82egL._AC_SL1202_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ifblue","source_asin":"B01LXF4CVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXF4CVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXF4CVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":995667,"name":"OKQ 60 Oz Stainless Steel Coffee Thermal Carafe - Double Walled Vacuum Insulated Thermos/Carafe with Lid - 12 Hour Heat Retention - Coffee/Tea Carafe ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KkybiUibL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We start a good day with a nice drink. When the morning coming, you are so happy to prepare for your loved coffee/drinks, because you are ready for traveling, outdoor activities, or parties, and hope to enjoy your yummy coffee at any time. This coffee carafe is made of stainless steel, which can keep coffee/other drinks warm/cold for 12 hours, keep hot for 6 hours. It’s slip-proof, so it won’t drop accidentally. How to use it? Store your coffee on the carafe, then close the lid. When you want to drink your coffee, use one hand to hold and press the switch to pour out the coffee.  Here are some questions you are sure to want to know. 1.How long will it keep water hot/warm We tested it with hot water, pour the hot water into the carafe and close the lid. After 12 hours, the temperature was 140°F. If you hope it keeps hot, it will do that for 6 hours. 2.will it wash by dishwasher? Yes, you can surely do that. 3.is it easy to clean? Yes, broad-mouth design allows you to easily put your hand into inner side when cleaning. It’s made of stainless steel, drinks will not remain on it. It comes with a cleaning brush that reaches into the bottom. 4.is it made of stainless steel? Yes, both inside and outside are stainless steel (please know that handle is not stainless steel)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KkybiUibL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKQ","source_asin":"B08C252ZPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C252ZPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C252ZPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
