window.products.push({"id":995680,"name":"Artist's Series Tiki Mug 4-Pack (Brown/Natural Glaze)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xsF4wrO3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Having been a staple of Tiki Farm's product line dating back to 2003, the artist’s series mugs “Ono Lono, Kalifornia Ku, Mondo Maori & Monster Marq” designed respectively by Crazy Al, Drew Brophy, Squid & Tiki Diablo are now available in a low-run brown/natural satin glaze combination. These mugs have proven timeless given their practical sizing, imprintable back surface, “core Tiki factor” and their universal appeal. Tiki Farm decided that since they haven’t produced any new glaze versions of these designs for many years, they'd do it up old-school like they did early on with these mugs and offer them up in a brand new glaze direction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xsF4wrO3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiki Farm","source_asin":"B004EHJCPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004EHJCPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004EHJCPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
