window.products.push({"id":995688,"name":"Knife Set with Block and Sharpener 5 Pieces，Stainless Steel Kitchen Knives Sets Acrylic Holder，Professional Chef Knife Sets Cooking Knife Set Knofe Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uIn+Y4YZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Great set for the kitchen】Professional stainless steel knife set contains all the tools you could possibly need: an 8\" chef's knife, an 8\" carving knife, an 8\" bread knife, a 5\" utility knife, a 3.5\" paring knife and a sharpener . it is suitable for home and restaurant. 【Super Sharp】Professional forging and polishing technology, the blade is super sharp, practical, and the cutting effect is more accurate. Each side of the blade is angled 15 degrees for unmatched efficiency! The unique pattern of the blade provides a beautiful appearance and prevents food from sticking to the blade. The integrated design of the blade and the handle is more durable. 【Ergonomic and easy to use】Each chef knife is forged from a single piece of high carbon stainless steel, creating a sharp professional quality blade far superior to ceramic and cheap acrylic knives. Balanced weight distribution and ergonomics minimize fatigue during cutting use, increasing cutting accuracy and efficiency. 【Easy to store and clean】All knives are safely stored in the knife holder, ensuring long-term durability of the tool. The knife holder is thick and transparent . Wash and dry with a soft cloth after each use to help maintain sharpness and prolong life. 【Quality Assurance】Each knife set is backed by excellent quality assurance, and multiple inspections are carried out before shipping to ensure that you can buy with confidence. If you have any questions about stainless steel knife sets, please feel free to contact us, we are always at your service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uIn+Y4YZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tatakook","source_asin":"B0BDFDLRGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFDLRGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFDLRGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":995689,"name":"Silk Rug Red Persian Area Rug Traditional Silk Rugs Living Room Accent Rug 5x7 Rug Soft Silk Office Rugs 5x8 Carpet High End Low Pile Silk Rugs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1+Zo+lVwsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This rug is a classically and modern designed area rug that is functional, casual, soft and comfortable, and it can be used as an accent or modern to your living room or dining area, foyer, back door, any place to which you want to add a touch of décor. Features of this durable rug include 100 percent high quality silk viscous yarn construction, stain and fade resistant material, rich, bold colors with a fine clear design throughout and a coordinated and contrasting center. Add color in front of your fireplace or dining room with this rug that is available in different sizes to suit your personal taste and needs. This rug can be spot cleaned with mild detergent and warm water. It is recommended that you vacuum this rug regularly to extend its life and visual appeal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1+Zo+lVwsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AS Quality Rugs","source_asin":"B0149X6S54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0149X6S54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0149X6S54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":995690,"name":"Cape Cod Round Tray Set, 3 Sturdy Pieces, 2 Rustic White and 1 Gray, Natural Wood, Nesting, 16-9.5 Diameter Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pbVbZGxTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SPRING READY Add a dash of coastal chic in your home with the Cape Cod Round Trays, set of 3. Comprised of 3 chic circular trays of gray (not teal) and white with natural wood rims, they neatly nest inside each other for easy storage. Use them to stylishly organize a variety of items, while punching up your décor with fresh rustic vibes. SOLD AS A SET OF 3, these well sized round trays measure in diameter and height as follows from large to small: 1- 15 3/4 D x 1 1/4 H, 2 - 13 D x 1 1/4 H, and 3 - 9 1/2 D x 1 1/4 H inches. QUALITY NATURAL WOOD Crafted of paulownia fortunei, these trays have fused vertical strips of that form their perimeters the the smaller and larger inset with solid white panels, the medium contrasting with gray. VERSATILE AND BEAUTIFUL Its perfect for serving small snacks and makes a great decoration when not in use. A long time secret of interior decorators, round decorative trays like these can be used to pick-up colors from other pieces in your space to pull a room together. AN IDEAL GIFT, it's perfect to celebrate holidays, birthdays, weddings and many more. So gorgeous, you'll want to keep it at home for yourself. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pbVbZGxTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B01BPP5AXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BPP5AXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BPP5AXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
