window.products.push({"id":995780,"name":"Ecolunchbox 3-in-1 Leak-Proof Stainless Steel Bento Box, Splash-Box (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NSeDjJkRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STACKING PLASTIC-FREE LUNCH BOX SET WITH SPACE-SAVING DESIGN: The 3-in-1 Splash Box is a three-piece stainless steel and silicone lunch box set with upper and lower levels plus a Mini Splash Pod nesting snack container. The snack container, which has a capacity of 5 oz (⅔ cup) has its own lid and can be nested inside the top layer or packed separately. The Blue Water Bento lunchbox’s modular design is compact, but it holds a generous 32 oz. (4 cups) of food all together. PACK A MAIN DISH UPSTAIRS PLUS 2 SIDE DISHES: The upper and lower levels strap together with a wavy silicone band that attaches to a wave-shaped latch. The nubby waves on the strap are non-slip and easy to use for ages 6 to adult. When assembled, the modular container measures 4 ¼ inches wide x 5 ¾ inches long x 3 ¾ inches tall. The top level is 1 ¾ deep. The bottom layer is 1 ½ inches deep. The Mini Splash Pod measures 3 ¼ inches long, 2 ½ inches wide and 1 ¾ inches tall. 100% PLASTIC FREE, NON BREAKABLE & BPA-FREE: Made from the highest quality 18/8 stainless steel and silicone components. Steel and silicone container is lighter than a comparable glass container and virtually non-breakable. Our stainless steel food containers are third party independently tested for food safety compliance with USA and EU standards. DISHWASHER SAFE: All parts of our metal and silicone bento boxes are dishwasher safe, including the lid! No need to hand wash silicone lids separately from the container bases like with other brands with lids made from plastic or with embedded gunky gaskets. TRUSTED MISSION-BASED BRAND: Eco mom and environmentalist Sandra Ann Harris designed the original ECOlunchbox stainless steel food container more than 10 years ago to pack lunches for her family. The woman-owned and led company continues as a mission-based, family-owned business dedicated to helping people reduce their dependence on plastics for health and environmental reasons. We stand behind our products and offer a one-year limited warranty against manufacturer’s defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NSeDjJkRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecolunchbox","source_asin":"B07BFDX441","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-995780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFDX441","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFDX441","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
